        "en": {
          "why_it_matters": "This is a farewell whose setting is part of the work, not just a bigger room. Tohji has built his career independently of a major label, and the final concert lands at Tokyo Dome—the image already embedded in Mall Boyz’s “Higher” and now made literal in a 2026 version filmed inside the Dome. With Tohji ending music activity in 2026 and naming this his last live performance, the night closes a distinctly contemporary Japanese career arc on its own chosen symbol.",
